  info: GPS tells the drone where it is. It enables GPS Rescue, which flies the drone
    back toward you in an emergency. Wire GPS TX to FC RX, and GPS RX to FC TX. Keep
    it at least 3cm away from the video antenna.
  whereItGoes: On top of the drone, away from other electronics and carbon fiber.
